      "committer": {
        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-24T15:02:44Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): a tool library file keeps a tool's drawn cutter\n\nExport writes a tool's drawn cutter (ToolCutter) as `cutter`, the\n[z, r, arc] points a .camproj tool stores, and the file then says\nversion 5 (CUTTER_VERSION), so an older reader refuses it by version\nand never drops the neck the stack laws read. The reader judges the\ncutter with project::cutter_from_dto and refuses a disagreeing one by\ntool name. ImportTools sets the cutter on Add, Update and Replace and\nrestores the previous one in the same undo step.\n\nFixes #3904\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
